  "problem": "Collection, retention, and control-plane topology bounds were unspecified, so later jobs could invent cheapest providers, arbitrary URLs, or unnamed descriptor hashes. PR-008 is present on this candidate but not accepted into integration.",
  "resulting_behavior": "Proposed ADR 0008 preserves the current static public runtime and leaves measured_cheapest_new_topology null. A fixture-only policy keeps activation false and reuses paused descriptor, harvest retry, and DLQ bounds. A standalone evidence-receipt contract records capture, 304 reuse, access-only, pre-egress, typed failure, truncation, and the unmatched Census 200-HTML historical negative with unknown redirect count. The committed fixture receipt is a sanitized projection that omits the historical query URL. Descriptor hash_basis is ushso-canonical-json.v1. No connector or ingestion bytes, live request, persistence, or GitHub publication occurred. PR-008 has no integration merge SHA.",
